The Fabric logo, used here to identify the Fabric mod loader. The official
artwork is https://github.com/FabricMC/community/blob/main/media/unascribed/png/fabric.png
(CC0 1.0, see media/unascribed/README.md there); this file is its 16x16 pixel
grid as SVG, pixel for pixel, without other changes.
